@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-04
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-04 v2. SysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed
' Approved figlib candidate v2 mapped to controlled ids. Not a proof of equivalence.
rectangle C
' group C: ibd / controller
component CT
' entity CT: Msess / holds H, q, journal
component PTL
' entity PTL: trace
component PCL
' entity PCL: constraint
component PHL
' entity PHL: candidate-set
component PSL
' entity PSL: test-selection
component PBL
' entity PBL: budget
component AD
' entity AD: Protocol adapter / connects to Mprot
component CE
' entity CE: Constraint evaluator
component CS
' entity CS: Candidate store / H_k
component TL
' entity TL: Test library / T(q_k): TEST, PREP, / RECOVER
component BC
' entity BC: Budget / K_{max} clock
AD --> PTL : c1 I_k, records
CE --> PCL : c2 verdict
PHL --> CS : c3 H_k
PSL --> TL : c4 T(q_k)
PBL --> BC : c5 cost, rounds
note as N1
  Only the adapter talks to Mprot;
  Msess never holds protocol state.
end note
note as N2
  Each action or ERROR costs at least
  c_{min} or one K_{max} round.
end note
@enduml
